      "comment": "LEKTRA SOLO (8) was a winner two back in one of the quickest times of the card when racing on speed but drifted back latest and safely held when 8th and beaten 22 lengths at The Meadows (31.69). Can atone. PAW WINKWORTH (2) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 450m behind Whodat Jewel (26.21) in a Grade 5. Form from his last run is proving strong. Shapes as one to consider. LEKTRA PRINCESS (1) could manage only second at Mt Gambier last time but caught the eye when posting a speedy 22.21 over 390m at this track three starts ago. Must include on winning run three back. BIG TIME GUNNAR (4) will run well despite no experience on this track.",
